OL,3,GNEWSAHow a phone call 40 years ago
OL,4,Achanged Ice Age history
OL,5,
OL,6,FA discovery which transformed
OL,7,Fscientists' understanding of the Ice
OL,8,FAge in western Europe is being
OL,9,Fremembered 40 years on.
OL,11,FThe remains of five mammoths were
OL,12,Funcovered by quarry workers at a gravel
OL,13,Fpit near Condover, Shropshire, in on 27
OL,14,FSeptember 1986.
OL,16,FInitially thought to possibly belong to
OL,17,Fa shire horse or even a circus
OL,18,Felephant, the bones turned out to
OL,19,Finclude the most complete adult mammoth
OL,20,Fskeleton found in Britain.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
