OL,4,Achanged Ice Age history
OL,5,
OL,6,FRadiocarbon dating placed the animals
OL,7,Fat about 14,000 years old, proving
OL,8,Fmammoths had survived in Britain
OL,9,Fthousands of years later than
OL,10,Fpreviously thought.
